) ? r.start + 1 : at; return; }   // on a base: hold\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Simplify the runner hold-on-base rule"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_013XFG9twe6SUVYioogU9PiJ":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-060015__x4549c1/work/BatzookaBaseball-Baseball-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-060015"}}}
